  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nSSO CAS configuration don't work as expected.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nFirst i configured a cas service in homeserver.yaml:\r\n\r\n```\r\nserver_name: \"domain.io\"\r\npublic_baseurl:\"im.domain.io\"\r\n\r\ncas_config:\r\n  enabled: True\r\n  server_url: \"https://im.domain.io/_matrix/cas_server.php\"\r\n\r\n```\r\nwhen reaching the server i'm getting redirected in loop to :\r\nhttps://im.domain.io/_matrix/client/r0/login/sso/redirect?redirectUrl=https%3A%2F%2Felement.domain.io%2F%23%2F\r\n\r\nIf i reach:\r\nhttps://im.domain.io/_matrix/cas_server.php/login?service=https%3A%2F%2Fim.domain.io%2F_matrix%2Fclient%2Fr0%2Flogin%2Fcas%2Fticket%3FredirectUrl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Felement.domain.io%252F%2523%252F\r\ni'm getting loggued and redirected properly\r\n\r\nIt seems that synapse doesn't redirect the user to the cas server url and i don't understand why.\r\nThe location header in the previous version was good and in 1.31.0 we get stuck in a redirect loop.\r\n\r\nI'm running synapse server v1.31.0.\r\nI don't get this problem in v1.28\r\n\r\n- **Version**: v1.31.0\r\n- **Install method**: from sources (yunohost)\r\n- **Platform**: VM / Debian buster\r\n",
